==Description==
The '''Guiding Star Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 38 of the regular [[The Final Act Event#The Final Act Battle Pass|The Final Act Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{PlushieSnowman|1,405}} or {{Robux|151}} ({{Robux|120}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{PlushieSnowman|24,055}} or {{Robux|3,366}} ({{Robux|3,366}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale).

It is nearly identical to the unreleased [[Constelation Nametag]]. It has a purple, yellow to purple gradient text with a translucent purple outline. Large purple smoke can be seen behind the text. There is a star constellation on it, which contains six stars connected by multiple yellow lines.

